[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2439935559","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2592#issuecomment-2439935559","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2592","id":2439935559,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86RbnZH","user":{"login":"xsuchy","id":85769,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NzY5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85769?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy","html_url":"https://github.com/xsuchy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-27T10:02:51Z","updated_at":"2024-10-27T10:02:51Z","body":"For the record, this was discussed in Fedora at https://gitlab.com/fedora/legal/fedora-license-data/-/issues/583 that has additional information.\r\n\r\nFull license text for you convenience\r\n```\r\nAdditional IP Rights Grant (Patents)\r\n\r\n\"This implementation\" means the copyrightable works distributed by\r\nGoogle as part of the Dart Project.\r\n\r\nGoogle hereby grants to you a perpetual, worldwide, non-exclusive,\r\nno-charge, royalty-free, irrevocable (except as stated in this\r\nsection) patent license to make, have made, use, offer to sell, sell,\r\nimport, transfer, and otherwise run, modify and propagate the contents\r\nof this implementation of Dart, where such license applies only to\r\nthose patent claims, both currently owned by Google and acquired in\r\nthe future, licensable by Google that are necessarily infringed by\r\nthis implementation of Dart. This grant does not include claims that\r\nwould be infringed only as a consequence of further modification of\r\nthis implementation. If you or your agent or exclusive licensee\r\ninstitute or order or agree to the institution of patent litigation\r\nagainst any entity (including a cross-claim or counterclaim in a\r\nlawsuit) alleging that this implementation of Dart or any code\r\nincorporated within this implementation of Dart constitutes direct or\r\ncontributory patent infringement, or inducement of patent\r\ninfringement, then any patent rights granted to you under this License\r\nfor this implementation of Dart shall terminate as of the date such\r\nlitigation is filed.\r\n```","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2439935559/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2440112577","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2592#issuecomment-2440112577","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2592","id":2440112577,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86RcSnB","user":{"login":"richardfontana","id":1179636,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzk2MzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1179636?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana","html_url":"https://github.com/richardfontana","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-27T17:39:20Z","updated_at":"2024-10-27T17:39:20Z","body":"The reason for the 'AdditionRef-' in the name is that I initially was going to suggest we not bother with applying for an SPDX identifier because of what I had thought was SPDX's preference to avoid dealing with things like this (i.e. supplementing standard open source licenses with patent license grants presented in separate files). So I told @solomoncyj we could just create a Fedora-defined AdditionRef- for the \"Additional IP Rights grant\". However, in another issue @jlovejoy indicated that it was appropriate to submit something like this to SPDX. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2440112577/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2440113779","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2592#issuecomment-2440113779","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2592","id":2440113779,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86RcS5z","user":{"login":"richardfontana","id":1179636,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzk2MzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1179636?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana","html_url":"https://github.com/richardfontana","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-27T17:43:23Z","updated_at":"2024-10-27T17:43:52Z","body":"SPDX might want to see whether the several known Google-maintained-project uses of things like this (off the top of my head, including Golang, Dart, WebM, WebRTC?) are close enough that a single identifier (or exception identifier) would be suitable, assuming SPDX wants to entertain this at all. Whether something like this fits with SPDX's standards for exceptions is not immediately clear to me. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2440113779/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2442566433","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2592#issuecomment-2442566433","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2592","id":2442566433,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86Rlpsh","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-28T20:32:57Z","updated_at":"2024-10-28T20:34:00Z","body":"@solomoncyj (sorry! gave wrong credit at first) thanks for submitting, and @richardfontana thanks for the additional context.\r\n\r\nI recall looking into these a few years ago, at #646. My recollection is (1) there's a bunch of variants Google has used that are close but not quite the same, as @richardfontana suggested; and (2) we decided at the time to err on the side of \"maybe these aren't really valid as exceptions.\" I'm still unsure how I feel about that, but open to revisiting it.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2442566433/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2580919896","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2592#issuecomment-2580919896","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2592","id":2580919896,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86Z1bZY","user":{"login":"karsten-klein","id":20038021,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMDM4MDIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20038021?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein","html_url":"https://github.com/karsten-klein","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-09T17:49:54Z","updated_at":"2025-01-09T17:49:54Z","body":"**{metæffekt} Universe**\r\nmarkers: Ownership Marker, Patent Information Marker\r\n\r\n**ScanCode**\r\nmatched id: [google-patent-license-golang](https://github.com/nexB/scancode-toolkit/blob/develop/src/licensedcode/data/licenses/google-patent-license-golang.LICENSE)\r\n\r\n**Comment** \r\n+1 to add in whatever form (yet not as exception). Generalization independent from project name required. See also https://github.com/spdx/change-proposal/blob/main/proposals/Modifiers.md.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2580919896/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2691793921","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2592#issuecomment-2691793921","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2592","id":2691793921,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86gcYQB","user":{"login":"Pizza-Ria","id":46799628,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2Nzk5NjI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46799628?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria","html_url":"https://github.com/Pizza-Ria","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizza-Ria/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-01T00:56:39Z","updated_at":"2025-03-01T00:56:39Z","body":"Inclined to agree with @karsten-klein - I don't recall that we have the concept of an \"additional rights grant\" in SPDX.  We have exceptions but maybe this is a different category that should be entertained.  DEFINITELY in favor of templatizing to the extent possible to capture as many Google variants as we can - perhaps a name that aligns with the match that Karsten found ([google-patent-license-golang](https://github.com/nexB/scancode-toolkit/blob/develop/src/licensedcode/data/licenses/google-patent-license-golang.LICENSE)) and also +1 to his Change Proposal at https://github.com/spdx/change-proposal/blob/main/proposals/Modifiers.md.  ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2691793921/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2758716715","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2592#issuecomment-2758716715","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2592","id":2758716715,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86kbq0r","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-27T16:44:42Z","updated_at":"2025-03-27T16:44:42Z","body":"discussed this on 3/27 call - given the long history of trying to sort out these Google extra patent grants that have a bunch of variations, we are not going to add this at this point either due to it's not really an \"exception\" in the common sense. Also, we now have the 'AdditionRef-' option which we did not have in prior discussions. ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2758716715/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]